          "line_end": 168,
          "line_start": 151,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "vibe-cy/cycode",
          "url": "https://github.com/vibe-cy/CyCode/blob/fbdb97f7432894e1a04e1f6f883464c31ba48255/README.md#L151-L168"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_805b0c9cc6e6316f732f9b7d6cd54e3528c21df6fd01568ca17e2e054ead5936"
      ],
      "text": "The project structure includes modules for the agent loop, CLI entry, config, context compression, LLM client, REPL, sessions, tool registry, built-in tools, and an Ink TUI."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_70126a05722a403f570a97d24a0037b32a28525525822748b8cbce8739809be7",
