        "slc_baff21eb53e949fcacd84c8c17cdd04243b8c46e6eeb143068d35fb775a4133e"
      ],
      "text": "Interactive mode provides slash commands including /reset, /model, /tokens, /compact, /diff, /save, and /sessions, plus quit/exit."
    },
